{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o191a","title":"曹操规划寿陵与功臣陪陵","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o191a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操令在西门豹祠西原建寿陵，因高为基不封不树，并为有功公卿将领规划陪陵。","evidence":["wudi-e-o191a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"定陵制","evidence":["wudi-e-o191a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"西门豹祠西原","evidence":["wudi-e-o191a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安二十三年六月","year":218,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o191a-q","wudi-q-o188","wudi-q-b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4"],"chronology":"wudi-y218","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o188","basis":"建安二十三年六月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,1075,"O191a"],"order":412}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o191a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-d204736b806e4100e182","layer":"original","quote":"六月，令曰：“古之葬者，必居瘠薄之地。其规西门豹祠西原上为寿陵〖9〗。因高为基，不封不树〖10〗。《周礼》，冢人掌公墓之地〖11〗：凡诸侯居左右以前，卿大夫居后。汉制亦谓之陪陵〖12〗。其公卿大臣、列将有功者，宜陪寿陵；其广为兆域〖13〗，使足相容。”","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":399,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十三年：建安二十三年（公元 218）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8cae36984cdc22e48444","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o188","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1336d4803d0b76311776","layer":"original","quote":"二十三年春正月〖1〗，汉太医令吉本与少府耿纪、司直韦晃等反〖2〗。攻许，烧丞相长史王必营〖3〗。﹝一﹞必与颍川典农中郎将严匡讨斩之〖4〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
